ciation of leasehold improvements in our New York headquarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/24/evercore-partners-inc-evr-q3-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2018 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"Demand for independent advice for both capital raising and balance sheet management is growing, as equity and debt issuance were strong for most of the year and restructuring of debt, including in-court bankruptcy cases grew.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/evercore-partners-inc-evr-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2018 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"For the year, we added 14 SMDs, eight recruited from other firms and six promoted internally, building our presence in consumer, adding to our strength in industrials, restructuring and private capital advisory and overall elevating our global reach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/evercore-partners-inc-evr-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"Here, restructuring, debt advisory and other strategic advisory assignments are more prevalent for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/evercore-inc-evr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"For example, we are seeing opportunities for strategic consolidation in sectors like healthcare and consumer, for restructuring in retail and energy, and for capital raising in both the public and private markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/evercore-inc-evr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"Our debt advisory and restructuring teams remain very productive as they continue to focus on refinancings, liability management and debt capital advisory globally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/evercore-inc-evr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"We have real tax expertise, we're adding expertise in corporate restructuring as opposed to financial restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/evercore-inc-evr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"An elevated level of leverage debt outstanding over time drives strong demand for liability management and restructuring advisory services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/evercore-inc-evr-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"Our debt advisory and restructuring teams continue to be fully engaged, and particularly strong levels in energy, retail and TMT exist.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/evercore-inc-evr-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"Demand for restructuring and more broadly debt advisory advice remained elevated as accommodative credit markets are driving higher levels of financial leverage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/evercore-inc-evr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2019 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"We advised on a large number of the most prominent M&A spin-off and restructuring and activists assignments of the year, including 7 of the 10 largest global M&A transactions and all of the five largest US transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/evercore-inc-evr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"Our restructuring, debt and equity capital markets advisory businesses are going flat-out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/evercore-inc-evr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"These businesses are smaller than our M&A advisory business and it will take time before the increase in revenue related to restructuring and debt and equity capital markets advisory activities are recognized.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/evercore-inc-evr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2020-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph L. Schlosstein","x":"And we have seen an unprecedented surge of restructuring and refinancing transactions often on a highly expedited basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/evercore-inc-evr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2020-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"We were fortunate to have the opportunity to assist our clients with broad-based debt advisory assignments, equity issuance, as well as advising them on restructuring challenges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/evercore-inc-evr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"…market for merger activity improve, and we continue to see robust activity in capital advisory, restructuring, underwriting and research and trading, we have never been more confident in our ability as a firm to help our clients achieve their most important strategic financial and capital…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/evercore-inc-evr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"Restructuring and refinancing transactions are continuing and we are having constant dialog with our clients about their future financing needs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/evercore-inc-evr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"Later in the second quarter, as fiscal and monetary stimulus stabilized the debt and equity markets, we helped client capitalize on the opportunity to build liquidity and in certain cases to initiate large restructuring and recapitalization transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/evercore-inc-evr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2020 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"We greatly strengthened our restructuring team by adding five new SMDs globally, dramatically enhanced our equity underwriting team, we enhanced our private capital raising capabilities for both sponsors and public and private companies, we strengthened our debt advisory capabilities, we added…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/evercore-inc-evr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2021 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Walsh","x":"…share creep that you see in the quarter is a little bit of a good news problem, which is the mechanics of share count as you think about the unvested RSUs is such that the number of shares that go into the share count increases significantly when your company share price increases significantly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/evercore-inc-evr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2021 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"With so much uncertainty and the weak economic environment and outlook, most of our clients turned inward to focus on operations, liquidity and in many cases, restructuring, while restructuring activity was -- and strategic activity was paused.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/evercore-inc-evr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2021 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"In the face of economic recovery and strength in M&A and capital raising, classic restructuring activity has slowed and is concentrated among key sectors and issuers that have not rebounded as quickly as some others have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/evercore-inc-evr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2021 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ralph Schlosstein","x":"Traditional restructuring opportunities have been more limited, given the strength of the economic recovery, the strong availability of credit and the positive environment for M&A and capital raising.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/evercore-inc-evr-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2021 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"In restructuring, many companies and sectors continue to take advantage of the strong economic recovery and access to capital to restructure out of court.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/evercore-inc-evr-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2021 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"The strong availability of credit and the pace of economic recovery has limited the need for traditional restructuring work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/evercore-inc-evr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2021 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"In restructuring, the strong economic recovery and access to capital is enabling companies to restructure out of court.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/evercore-inc-evr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"James Edwin Yaro","x":"But perhaps you could talk about whether in the boardroom, you're still seeing impacts from tariffs weighing on potential transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/evercore-evr-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"The liability management and restructuring group continues to see strong activity levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/evercore-evr-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John S. Weinberg","x":"PCA restructuring, activism defense, those are very, very good businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/evercore-evr-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Mooallem","x":"And we've talked about this before, but surface park single-level retail centers, especially in the Northeast, there's just not going to be a whole lot more of them, so we think we have pricing power with the ones we do own.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/evercore-evr-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Langer","x":"On the G&A front, I can tell you, we've worked very hard over the last few years to continue to do everything we can, whether it's rightsizing the enterprise, looking at efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/evercore-evr-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"The liability management and restructuring group had a strong close to the year, generating its second-best year for revenues and notably well above last year's performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/evercore-evr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"Activity in the quarter and year reflected a more balanced mix of liability management and traditional restructuring activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/evercore-evr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2025 Q4","e":"evr","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Kaczarov","x":"I was wondering if you could talk to us about the potential disruption risks AI may pose to your pipelines and if you can provide any color on sector exposures in your backlogs, both on the public and private sides, that would be very helpful.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/evercore-evr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"Industry-wide, announced global M&A activity, excluding several large direct AI investments totaled over $1 trillion in the first quarter, up 11% from the prior year period with large-cap strategic transactions continuing to outperform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/evercore-evr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"There is no question that there is an investment theme that having AI as a part of business, there are going to be certain businesses that are going to do a lot better because they have AI and they're doing -- using AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/evercore-evr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"The liability management and restructuring business maintained robust activity levels in the quarter with continued strength in client dialogues in recent months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/evercore-evr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q1","e":"evr","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"In terms of restructuring, we are seeing a lot of activity really across the board, multiple sectors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/evercore-evr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy LaLonde","x":"And there's a little bit of pricing power there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/evercore-evr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2026-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"Further, 7 additional SMDs have committed to join our growing global investment banking franchise in key areas, including restructuring in the U.S. and Europe, health care, chemicals and equity capital markets as well as 2 new hires based in our Frankfurt office.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/evercore-evr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2026-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"Liability management and restructuring business maintained strong activity and dialogue levels consistent with trends we have seen.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/evercore-evr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q2","e":"evr","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"We are also seeing more companies pursue M&A to achieve scale and to respond to the technological transformation and disruption brought on by AI, which we expect to be a driver of activity across a number of sectors over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/evercore-evr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2026-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"While the market backdrop remains complex, including interest rates uncertainty, continued geopolitical tensions, and evolving implications of AI, we believe the underlying environment for investment banking activity remains constructive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/evercore-evr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2026-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"…power development project, Broadcom on a transaction enabling the deployment of $63 billion of AI compute capacity to Anthropic, which announced earlier this week. Consistent with trends in the first half, our liability management and restructuring business maintained strong activity levels as","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/evercore-evr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EVR 2026 Q3","e":"evr","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Weinberg","x":"Further, an additional SMD has committed to join our restructuring group and will be based in France.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/evercore-evr-q3-2026-earnings-call-tra